 "public compileSource: source <String> ifSuccess: successBlock <[:MethodMirror | Object]> ifFailure: failureBlock <[:String | Object]> = (\n			(* Run the source through prettyPrintLazySlotOr: first so the\n	   stored declaration matches what the pretty printer would\n	   emit on reopen -- enforces canonical formatting at accept\n	   time. Falls back to the original on any printer failure. *)\n			\n			| canonical |\n			canonical:: ide prettyPrintLazySlotOr: source.\n			[\n				| builder <MixinBuilder> newBuilder <LazySlotBuilder> newMirror <LazySlotMirror> |\n				builder:: definingMixin asBuilder.\n				newBuilder:: builder lazySlots addFromSource: canonical.\n				ide installFromBuilders: {builder declaration. }.\n				newMirror:: definingMixin lazySlots findMirrorNamed: newBuilder name.\n				successBlock value: newMirror\n			] on: Error do: [:ex <Exception> | failureBlock value: ex printString ]\n		)",
 "public lazySlotTemplateText ^<String> = (\n			^'lazy slotName = expression.'\n		)",
