 "public runCurrentProgram = (\n			(* Are we looking at an app we can run? *)\n			\n			(* Bogus: We could be in an object presenter for such a class, and need to handle that case as well *)\n			\n			(currentPresenter isKindOfClassPresenter and: [\n					currentPresenter subject isApplicationConfiguration\n				]) ifTrue: \n				(* If so, run it *)\n				[ currentPresenter subject respondToRunApp: false ]\n				ifFalse: \n				(* else, give an error message saying there is no runnable program *)\n				[ 'You must be browsing an application class to run it.' out ]\n		)",
