 "public class CommitVsParentStrategy onRepository: r <Repository> commit: entry = ApplyStrategy new (\n		(* Read-only browse strategy: shows the diff between commit `entry`\n   and its first parent (empty tree for root commits). The Member-\n   HistoryEntryPresenters inside the embedded ChangesetPresenter\n   stay editable -- their Make Live wires to the live class (via\n   the existing namespace lookup) when one exists, so the user can\n   cherry-pick a historical method into the current image. There\n   is no top-level Accept / Cancel: requiresApply ^ false makes\n   the presenter skip the action / message / author rows. *)\n		\n		|\n			public repository = r.\n			public commitEntry = entry.\n		|\n	)",
