 "public class Folder named: n <String>\n	(* :exemplar: Folder named: #ExemplarFolder *)\n	 = Object new (\n		|\n			public name = n.\n			directory = JSZip new folder: n.\n			innerDir = directory folder: n.\n		|\n	)",
