 "public selectors ^<List[Symbol]> = (\n			(* The selectors of every send in the method, decoded from its V5 bytecode record (psoup MethodMirror parity; drives senders). Methods without a record - JS-only bodies, images predating dual emission, reflectively edited classes - answer the empty list. *)\n\n			| record |\n			nil = simulation ifTrue: [ ^List new ].\n			record:: bytecodeRecord.\n			nil = record ifTrue: [ ^List new ].\n			^(simulation SelectorCollector overBytecode: (record at: 1)\n				literals: (record at: 2)) selectors\n		)",
