 "public addFromSource: src <String> ^<ClassDeclarationBuilder> = (\n			(* Compile a fresh top-level class declaration from src and add a\n	   builder for it. Per-mixin nesting context is currently approximate\n	   ([within: nil] for the compile step); install resolves naming. *)\n			\n			| ir newCDB |\n			(* [src] is a bare class declaration; with [within: nil] the compiler\n	   parses a COMPILATION UNIT, so prepend the unit header exactly as\n	   class-side fromSource: does. Without it the parse failed with\n	   ParserError ''class expected'' (which Message>>sendTo: then\n	   masked as an MNU, before its 2026-07-14 fix). *)\n			ir:: compiler compileClassSource: 'Newspeak3 ''Uncategorized'' ' , src within: nil.\n			newCDB:: IRBasedClassDeclarationBuilder fromIR: ir\n				existingMixin: nil\n				within: definingMixin declaration.\n			removeMirrorNamed: newCDB simpleName.\n			addMirror: newCDB.\n			^newCDB\n		)",
