 "class ClassHeaderBuilder onDeclarationBuilder: b <ClassDeclarationBuilder> = AbstractClassHeaderMirror new (\n		(* The header facet of a ClassDeclarationBuilder, mirroring the psoup\n   ClassHeaderBuilder API (MirrorsForPrimordialSoup). [source:] stages a new\n   header on the declaration builder; the change takes effect when the builder\n   is installed, which recompiles the whole class from its reconstructed\n   source. If the new header changes the slot layout, installation flows into\n   the schema-change path (live instances reshaped, basicNews rebuilt). *)\n		|\n			public declarationBuilder <ClassDeclarationBuilder> = b.\n		|\n	)",
 "new",
 "new",
 "public name = (\n			^declarationBuilder name\n		)",
 "public preamble ^<String> = (\n			(* Foo factory = SuperFoo superFactory *)\n\n			| headerAst |\n			headerAst:: compilation parser parseClassHeader: source.\n			^source copyFrom: headerAst start to: headerAst superConstructorCall end\n		)",
