 "definingClassMirror ^<ClassMirror | nil> = (\n			(* The NS class whose mixin defines the frame's method. The simulator query is non-raising and covers flat-patched primitive receivers (their runtime chain materializes no applications) via the NS class chain - displaying a transplanted frame must never fail on an unresolvable mixin. *)\n\n			| nsClass |\n			nsClass:: thread simulator newspeakClassApplying: reflectee method mixin\n				startingAt: (classOfReflectee: reflectee receiver).\n			nil = nsClass ifTrue: [ ^nil ].\n			^ClassMirror reflecting: nsClass\n		)",
