 "class AddableList[E] new = AbstractList[E] new (\n		(* AddableLists are Lists that support the Extensible protocol, and which support indexing in constant time. *)\n		\n		|\n			contents <Array[E]>\n			startGap <Integer>\n			\n			(* number of empty slots at the beginning of contents *)\n			lastIndex <Integer>\n		|\n		\n		(* (internal) index of last occupied table entry *)\n		initCapacity: self class defaultCapacity.\n	)",
