 "public detect: aBlock <[:E | Boolean]> ifFound: foundBlock <[def Y] | [:E | Y]> ifNone: exceptionBlock <[def X]> ^<Y | X> = (\n			self do: [:each <E> |\n					(aBlock value: each) ifTrue: [ ^foundBlock cull: each ]\n				].\n			^exceptionBlock value\n		)",
