 "public testSelfTypeExposesOnlyPublicMethods = (\n			(* Test that Self type only exposes public methods *)\n			\n			| eset = typechecker typecheckMethodSource: 'test ^ <Number> = (| obj <Self> = returnSelf. | ^obj publicMethod)'\n				ofClass: SelfTypeTestClass. |\n			assert: [ eset isEmpty ]\n				description: 'Should allow access to public method through Self type'\n		)",
