 "public testClosureInInnerAccessingOuter = (\n			(* Test that a closure defined in inner class can directly access outer private slot *)\n			\n			| innerClass = ClosureLexicalOuter new ClosureLexicalMiddle new ClosureLexicalInner. eset = typechecker typecheckMethodSource: 'test ^ <Number> = (| closure <[Number]> = [outerPrivateSlot]. | ^closure value)'\n				ofClass: innerClass. |\n			assert: [ eset isEmpty ]\n				description: 'Should allow closure in inner class to access outer private slot'\n		)",
