 "class TextBlockFragment onText: t <Text> subfragments: sfs <List[Fragment]> = TextFragment onText: t (\n		(* A fragment representing a compound text . *)\n		\n		|\n			subfragments <List[Fragment]> = sfs.\n		|\n	)",
